000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TWOINVCH.
000400 AUTHOR.               GAYLE TAYLOR.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         APRIL 2, 1986.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE
000900*                      DETAIL TRANSACTION DATA SET
001000*                      AND FIND ALL INV TRANSACTIONS, SORT BY
001100*                      DATE AND ACCOUNT, AND THEN PRINT EACH
001200*                      INVOICE TRANSACTION CHARGED TO WORK ORDERS
001300*                      WITH THE PURCHASE ORDER DESCRIPTION.
      *C
      *C   28FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   06SEP1996    DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C     ALSO REVISED PROGRAM TO CALL TBLOWUP FOR FATAL ERRORS.
      *C
001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
002000
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DTRANS-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPODATAITM-PO-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

002700 DATA DIVISION.
003000
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DTRANS-MC-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-MC-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0700  OF MCFLCA0701.

       FD  DPODATAITM-PO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPODATAITM-PO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1100  OF MCFLCS1101.

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

